      "paper": "PC-2",
      "topic": "Statistics and its application for audit",
      "chapterId": "pc2_s5_c3",
      "chapter": "Basic Concepts of Correlation",
      "fact": "c.) What is the ratio of people who prefer green to those who prefer blue?",
