      "fact": "Automated Duplicate and Split Payment Detection: Deploying fuzzy string matching (Levenshtein distance) and clustering algorithms across procurement datasets to detect vendors splitting invoices to circumvent DFPR 1978 thresholds or claiming duplicate payments across different DDO codes.",
