      "topic": "1.4 Introduction to AI/ML: Basic concepts and real-world applications in auditing",
      "fact": "Geospatial and Remote Sensing Audit: Applying Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) to high-resolution satellite imagery (ISRO Bhuvan / Cartosat) to independently verify physical milestones in road construction (PMGSY), afforestation coverage (CAMPA), or illegal sand mining.",
      "tag": "Syllabus Key Fact",
      "chapterId": "pc11_s3_c1",
      "chapter": "(i) Basic understanding of functioning of treasuries & IFMS Modules"
