      "topic": "1.4 Introduction to AI/ML: Basic concepts and real-world applications in auditing",
      "fact": "Audit Evidence Sanctity: An AI prediction or risk score is an indicator, not definitive proof. It must be corroborated by physical documentation, verified vouchers, and management responses to constitute valid audit evidence under the Regulations on Audit and Accounts 2020.",
