      "topic": "3.1 Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Threats, vulnerabilities, risk mitigation & EDR",
      "fact": "Perimeter and Network Security: Next-Generation Firewalls (NGFW), Intrusion Detection and Prevention Systems (IDS/IPS), Demilitarized Zones (DMZs), and network segmentation isolating accounting networks from public internet access.",
