      "fact": "Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR):\n  - Advanced security solutions deployed across all endpoints (desktops, servers, mobile devices) providing continuous behavioral monitoring, real-time threat detection, and automated endpoint isolation upon detecting anomalous execution patterns.",
