      "topic": "3.1 Cybersecurity Fundamentals: Threats, vulnerabilities, risk mitigation & EDR",
      "fact": "Zero Trust Architecture (ZTA): Operating on the operational maxim \"Never Trust, Always Verify\", enforcing continuous verification of every user, device, and application regardless of network location.",
