      "topic": "CPWA Code Pointers",
      "fact": "Percentage deductions for security deposits, related to estimate cost of the work awarded, made from contractors’ bills, should be credited to Major /Minor Head “8443- Civil Deposits”-108-Public Works Deposits” with sub-head “Cash deposits of contractors”",
      "tag": "CPWA Code",
      "chapterId": "pc4_s3_c3",
