      "fact": "If so desired by a tenderer, a duplicate set of tender documents, duly stamped as Duplicate\", may be issued to him an additional cost of the tender papers. The duplicate set of documents cannot be submitted as a tender. In case of loss or defacing of the original set of documents, the contractor shall be required to buy a second set and submit it a",
